  "sourceInterpretation": [
    "The P054 root frame 1 calls _level0.InternalPreloader.gotoAndPlay(jump_check) and stops; the exact indexMI source places an InternalPreloader instance with that label.",
    "The host loader uses animation_mc.loadMovie(playSwfFileName,1) and the preloader advances animation_mc to begin after loading; the lesson XML names GS/L2GS03.swf as the active Game 2 page.",
